  Scott Metzger (guitar)—distill road-honed improv instincts as seen with
  their time with Trey Anastasio Band (TAB) and Joe Russo’s Almost Dead (
 JRAD) into taut\, instrumental epics. The trio has hewn their own path beh
 ind their latest release\, One Of Us\, with kaleidoscopic interplay and cl
 ub-shifting grooves\, serving as a pure distillation of the LaMP sound and
  a mission statement of improvisational group-think.\nhttps://tickets.venu
 epilot.com/e/lamp-2026-12-06-stone-church-brattleboro-fb7f04\nFrom Pushpin
