SUMMARY:Suitcase Junket
LOCATION:Stone Church\, 210 Main St\, Brattleboro\, VT 05301
DESCRIPTION:Over the past twenty years\, intriguingly single-minded songwri
 ter/multi-instrumentalist Matt Lorenz has earned snowballing acclaim for h
 is achingly poetic dark folk as The Suitcase Junket. A solitary artist wit
 h an organic yet ornate vision\, his seventh album\, To Go On is his most 
 acutely profound yet. Created in the wake of losing his sister\, singer-so
 ngwriter Kate Lorenz\, it’s a tender\, beautiful\, and arrestingly movin
 g record\; an internal dialogue and conversation with the departed\, enorm
 ously resonant to anyone who ever loved anyone. “Kate’s more on my min
 d than she ever would have been if she was alive\, so there’s something 
 sweet in that sadness\,” Lorenz mulled from his family homestead in west
 ern Massachusetts. “When I’m singing and performing\, I feel closer to
  her.”\nhttps://tickets.venuepilot.com/e/suitcase-junket-2027-02-13-ston
 e-church-brattleboro-60d590\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.ci
